				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Tune in to Channel 4 at midnight tonight to watch <strong>Superstar DJs</strong> starring <strong>Diplo</strong>. The fifth episode of the TV series host by DJ and Radio 1 host <strong>Annie Mac</strong> will whisk through the private life and public performances of <strong>Diplo</strong>. The show lasts 25 mins.</p>
<p>You can watch the trailer of the episode with <strong>Diplo</strong> above. Note that at 0:32 you can briefly hear <strong>Madonna</strong>.</p>
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" width="550"><p>Madonna dub plates, bikini clad girls, stage dives and a boat-clash &#8211; it could only be <a href="https://twitter.com/hashtag/SuperstarDJs?src=hash">#SuperstarDJs</a> with <a href="https://twitter.com/diplo">@diplo</a> <a href="http://t.co/iZwrDXwv6g">http://t.co/iZwrDXwv6g</a></p>
<p>&mdash; Annie Mac (@AnnieMac) <a href="https://twitter.com/AnnieMac/statuses/491532518458683392">July 22, 2014</a></p></blockquote>
<p><script async src="//platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script></p>
<blockquote class="pixcode  pixcode--testimonial  testimonial testimonial--small-text">
    <div class="testimonial__content">
<p><strong>Annie Mac</strong> heads to Las Vegas to track down American DJ, record label boss and producer to the stars <strong>Diplo</strong>.</p>
</div>

    </blockquote>

<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/diplo-superstar-djs-annie-mac-tonight-channel-4/20140723">Diplo on Superstar DJs with Annie Mac tonight on Channel 4</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna new album news unapologetic</a>.</p>
