<blockquote class="pixcode  pixcode--testimonial  testimonial testimonial--small-text">
    <div class="testimonial__content">
<p>I&#8217;d still love <strong>Madonna</strong>, and I think that&#8217;ll happen.</p>
</div>

    
        
            <div class="testimonial__author-name">Andy Cohen</div>
        
        
        
    </blockquote>

<p>&#8220;The best guests for me are people who I&#8217;m actually a big fan of and very invested in,&#8221; <strong>Cohen</strong> adds.</p>
